    <string name="kid_mode_enable">Enable kid mode</string>
    <string name="kid_mode_limits">Limits depend on the enforcement mode. Accessibility / launcher modes are convenience aids (ADB or force-stop can bypass). Device Owner + lock task is much stronger, but requires a one-time ADB provision on a device with no accounts (or after factory reset).</string>
